  Definition:
    Name: Flame Wall
    Description: 'Sets the ground alight for 4 seconds: whoever of the other side
      stands in it burns each second. The fire carries its radius, lifetime, pace
      and heat as attributes of its own, its radius and heat by the ability''s level,
      and its burns read its heat.'
